      "description": "Welcome to Steady Sip Family!\nWe are ready stock in Malaysia 🇲🇾\nOrder will ship normally 1-2 working days once you had place your order! 🚚\n\nWhy choose us?\nChoose us for a seamless online shopping experience with a wide selection of quality products, competitive prices, and exceptional customer service that will exceed your expectations ✨\n\nProduct feature:\nMaterial: Borosilicate \nSize: 350ml -700ml\n\n-Made with the finest borosilicate glass, this tumbler boasts excellent thermal resistance, ensuring your cold beverages stay chilled for longer periods. Whether it's a refreshing iced tea, a zesty lemonade, or a fruity cocktail, this tumbler keeps your drinks cool and refreshing, making it an ideal choice for hot summer days or whenever you need a cool sip of rejuvenation.\n\n-With its sleek and ergonomic design, this tumbler fits comfortably in your hand, allowing you to enjoy your favorite beverages with ease. The clear glass construction beautifully showcases the vibrant colors of your drinks, making them even more appealing.\n\n-Whether you prefer a refreshing iced coffee, a chilled fruit smoothie, or a cozy cup of tea, this tumbler is up for the task. Its ability to maintain temperature, coupled with its optical clarity, makes it the perfect vessel to showcase and enjoy a variety of beverages throughout the day.\n\n-In addition to its impressive optical clarity and temperature range, our tumbler is dishwasher safe, allowing for effortless cleaning and maintenance. Simply place it in the dishwasher, and it will come out sparkling clean, ready for your next delightful drink.\n\n",
